  "reason": "The strongest completed result is config_002, where multiprofile RNA with PCA and avgpool reaches 0.591 accuracy and 0.573 F1, clearly above single-profile RNA and far above image-only ResNet50. The key remaining uncertainty is whether transformer aggregation improves over avgpool for this promising RNA multiprofile setting. config_003 changes only aggregation from avgpool to transformer, keeping model setting, profile setting, and RNA encoder fixed, so it cleanly isolates the aggregation effect. This is a high-value exploitation step: it may directly improve performance and also tells whether transformer aggregation is worth carrying into later multimodal experiments."
}

